# Options: save, audio, terrain detail, the load menu.
Return Return @snap:hub
Up       @snap:options_sel       # hub row 5 OPTIONS
Return   @snap:options
Return T 1 Return @snap:saved   # row 0 SAVE_CAMPAIGN, the name "T1", saved
# No snap while the name box waits: its cursor blinks on the real-time timer
# (campaignTimerAlternatingPhase), so that frame depends on the host.
Down Down @snap:audio_sel        # row 2 TOGGLE_AUDIO
Return   @snap:audio
Down     @snap:detail_sel        # row 3 CYCLE_TERRAIN_DETAIL
Return   @snap:detail
Up Up    @snap:load_sel          # row 1 OPEN_LOAD_MENU
Return   @snap:load
Up       @snap:load_done_sel     # row 12 OPTIONS
Return   @snap:options_again
Up Up    @snap:options_done_sel  # back on row 1; row 6 PLANET_HUB
Return   @snap:hub_back
